# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# Updater signing keys -- never commit these, they're stored as GitHub
# Actions secrets (TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY / _PASSWORD) instead. Covers
# both the private key (*.key) and the public key file the CLI writes
# alongside it (*.key.pub).
*.key
*.key.pub
